@startuml
title OrderFulfillmentWorkflow.execute 循序圖

skinparam defaultFontName "Heiti TC"
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #64748B
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActorBorderColor #475569
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B7791F
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7D6

actor "OrderPlaced\nstarter" as Starter
actor "取消入口" as CancelClient
participant "OrderFulfillment\nWorkflow" as WF
participant "Inventory\nActivities" as INV
participant "Ordering\nActivities" as ORD
participant "WMS\nActivities" as WMS
participant "可設定延遲的模擬 WMS\nScheduler" as SimWms
participant "Integration Event\nAdapter" as EventAdapter

Starter -> WF: start execute(OrderFulfillmentInput)
activate WF
note right of WF
  Workflow 先送出 RequestAllocation，
  Shipment 建立前的取消在 allocation wait checkpoint 處理。
end note

group Shipment 建立前：配貨
  WF -> INV: requestAllocation(RequestAllocationActivityInput)
  INV --> WF: command committed
  note over WF: await AllocationCommitted\n或 CancellationRequestInput

  alt Shipment 建立前收到取消
    CancelClient -> WF: requestCancellation(Update)
    WF --> CancelClient: ACCEPTED
    WF -> ORD: cancelOrder(CancelOrder)
    ORD --> WF: completed
    break Workflow 以 ORDER_CANCELLED 結束
      WF --> Starter: ORDER_CANCELLED
    end
  else 配貨完成
    EventAdapter ->> WF: allocationCommitted(Signal)
  end
end

group 下達倉庫出庫需求（WMS 建立 Shipment）
  WF -> WMS: releaseToWarehouse(ReleaseToWarehouseActivityInput)
  opt Activity 尚未回傳時，handover fact 已先到
    SimWms ->> EventAdapter: ShipmentHandedOver Outbox -> Kafka
    EventAdapter ->> WF: shipmentHandedOverToCarrier(Signal)
    note over WF: Signal 可先記入 checkpoint；取得 shipmentId 後再做 correlation
  end
  WMS --> WF: ReleaseToWarehouseActivityResult(shipmentId)
end

group Shipment 已建立：等待 handover，可被取消中斷
  note over WF: await Shipment terminal Signal\n或 CancellationRequestInput

  alt correlated handover 已先成立
    CancelClient -> WF: requestCancellation(Update)
    WF --> CancelClient: REJECTED
    note over WF: 不保存新 request、不送 WMS cancellation command
  else WMS 正常完成倉內作業
    SimWms -> SimWms: Wave -> Release -> Pick -> Pack -> Stage
    SimWms ->> EventAdapter: ShipmentHandedOver Outbox -> Kafka
    EventAdapter ->> WF: shipmentHandedOverToCarrier(Signal)
  else Shipment 存在後收到取消
    CancelClient -> WF: requestCancellation(Update)
    WF --> CancelClient: ACCEPTED
    WF -> WMS: requestShipmentCancellation(CancelShipmentActivityInput)
    WMS --> WF: command committed
    note over WMS
      CREATED／WAVE_PLANNED／RELEASED 可立即完成；
      已開始作業則進入 CANCELLING，
      由 WMS recovery backlog 稍後完成。
    end note
    note over WF: await ShipmentCancelledInput\n或 ShipmentHandedOverToCarrierInput

    alt cancellation terminal 先提交
      WMS ->> EventAdapter: ShipmentCancelled Outbox -> Kafka
      EventAdapter ->> WF: shipmentCancelled(Signal, cancellationRequestId, actual cancelledAt)
      WF -> ORD: cancelOrder(CancelOrder)
      ORD --> WF: completed
      break Workflow 以 ORDER_CANCELLED 結束
        WF --> Starter: ORDER_CANCELLED
      end
    else carrier handover 在 recovery 前提交
      SimWms ->> EventAdapter: ShipmentHandedOver Outbox -> Kafka
      EventAdapter ->> WF: shipmentHandedOverToCarrier(Signal)
      note over WF: 正常履約路線勝出；保留已受理取消請求並繼續 fulfillment
    end
  end
end

group 完成出庫與 Order
  WF -> INV: completeOutboundMovements(...)
  INV --> WF: completed
  WF -> ORD: recordOrderFulfillment(...)
  ORD --> WF: completed
  WF --> Starter: FULFILLMENT_COMPLETED
end

deactivate WF

legend bottom
  ->  Activity／Update 等待處理結果
  ->> Integration fact Signal（非同步）
endlegend
@enduml
